Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Tue Oct 27 18:18:28 2026 +1100

    Import os_ken only when validating an ethertype
    
    Importing neutron_lib.api.validators loaded 46 os_ken modules for one
    lookup in validate_ethertype(), which only runs when sg_filter_ethertypes
    is set. Dropping it saves about 8MB of anonymous memory in each of
    neutron-api, the OVN agent and the L3 agent.
    
    Import ether_types inside that branch, and add a test that importing the
    validators does not load os_ken.
    
    Prompt: Mikal asked for privsep memory fixes that can be landed one at a
    time and measured in devstack CI; neutron daemons are the largest.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 (medium effort)
    
    Depends-On: https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/devstack/+/1011992
    Change-Id: I8b593cf89e51d26b44dc58c04a6288c0f9670e88
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

